flowchart TB
    customer[Customer] --> ui
    staff[Support staff and administrator] --> ui
    ui[React and TypeScript browser UI<br/>Catalog, owned orders, chat, staff inbox, administration]
    ui -->|Same-origin JSON, session cookie, CSRF writes| api

    subgraph backend[FastAPI modular monolith]
        api[API and authentication<br/>Roles, ownership, validation]
        api --> support[Conversation and support workflows]
        api --> core[Catalog, orders and admin services]
        support --> policy[Backend policy and routing rules<br/>Proposal checks, idempotency, queue and claim]
        support --> classify[Local intent classifier<br/>TF-IDF plus logistic regression and rules]
        support --> retrieve[Approved latest-document retrieval]
        retrieve --> local[Cached local CPU sentence transformer<br/>Explicit TF-IDF fallback]
        retrieve --> adapter[Optional guarded generation adapter<br/>Free route checks, redaction, bounded requests]
        adapter --> gate[Recheck assistant ownership<br/>before publishing an answer]
        policy --> persistence[SQLAlchemy and Alembic<br/>Transactions, unique keys, order version checks]
        core --> persistence
        support --> persistence
        retrieve --> persistence
    end

    persistence --> db[(SQLite WAL default<br/>Optional configured PostgreSQL)]
    adapter -. Optional HTTPS only .-> router[OpenRouter reviewed free model route<br/>External service exception]
    cache[(Local reviewed model files)] -. No implicit download .-> local
    data[(Synthetic training and evaluation data)] --> classify
    db --> audit[Audit records and source versions]
    adapter --> log[Model, prompt, source, latency and outcome log metadata]
    note[No real checkout, charge, refund or carrier API.<br/>pgvector indexing is deferred; retrieval vectors are in process.]
    db --- note
